      "url": "https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/education/news/vaibhav-taneja-educational-qualifications-how-this-du-graduate-became-the-cfo-of-elon-musk-led-tesla/articleshow/121332185.cms",
      "offset": 10000,
      "end": 12400,
      "next_offset": 12400,
      "section": {
        "heading": "[TOI](https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com \"News\")",
        "offset": 629
      },
      "content": "sofindia.indiatimes.com/education/news/upsc-cse-prelims-2025-answer-key-released-for-gs-paper-1-and-2-check-details-here/articleshow/121333457.cms)\n[DHSE plus 2 Result Official Website](https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/education/news/kerala-dhse-2-result-2025-official-vs-unofficial-websites-and-how-to-check-plus-2-results-safely/articleshow/121336323.cms)\n# Vaibhav Taneja educational qualifications: How this DU graduate became the CFO of Elon Musk-led Tesla\n[Lakshima Sareen](https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/toireporter/author-lakshima-sareen-479268908.cms) / TOI Education /  May 22, 2025, 16:30 IST\nShare\n[](https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/articleshowprint/121332185.cms \"print article\")\nAA\n+**Text Size**\n  * Small\n  * Medium\n  * Large\n\n\nVaibhav Taneja, born in Delhi, rose through the ranks with unwavering discipline and financial expertise. Starting from Delhi University and PwC, he joined SolarCity and then Tesla. In August 2023, Taneja became Tesla's CFO, and in 2024, he became the highest-paid CFO globally, marking a journey of quiet determination and sharp financial acumen.\n![Vaibhav Taneja educational qualifications: How this DU graduate became the CFO of Elon Musk-led Tesla](https://static.toiimg.com/thumb/msid-121332152,imgsize-18306,width-400,resizemode-4/121332152.jpg)\nIn the world of high-stakes corporate finance, where headlines are often dominated by Wall Street veterans and Silicon Valley prodigies, one name has quietly risen to the top: [Vaibhav Taneja](https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/topic/vaibhav-taneja).Born in 1977 and raised in Delhi, India, Taneja wasn’t always in the limelight. He didn’t come from a famous business family or boast an Ivy League degree. But what he did have was an unwavering love for numbers, a methodical mind, and the kind of discipline that often goes unnoticed—until it changes everything.Today, Taneja is the Chief Financial Officer of [Tesla](https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/topic/tesla), one of the most valuable companies on the planet. In 2024, he became the highest-paid CFO in the world, earning a jaw-dropping $139.5 million in a single year. But his journey to that role didn’t happen overnight—it was built over decades of hard work, quiet leadership, and smart choices.\n## Roots in Delhi: A foundation of discipline\nTaneja’s journey began in the classrooms of Delhi University, where he earned his Bach",
